# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — Sauti Unity Plugin
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# What this file ignores: build artefacts, IDE noise, OS junk, downloadable
# AI-model binaries, and CI outputs. What it keeps: every source file +
# manifest + schema + JSON template + knowledge-base markdown + every
# README.md and CHANGELOG.md.
#
# Convention: prefer explicit patterns over broad wildcards. Per-line
# comments document the "why" so a future contributor can challenge each
# decision individually.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── Unity-generated folders (regenerated on every Editor launch) ─────────────
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# ─── Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code / IDEA ───────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.vsconfig
.idea/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# ─── Asset .meta files for ignored folders ────────────────────────────────────
[Ll]ibrary.meta
[Tt]emp.meta
[Oo]bj.meta
[Bb]uild.meta
[Bb]uilds.meta
[Ll]ogs.meta
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings.meta
[Mm]emoryCaptures.meta

# ─── OS / shell junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Unity package manager lockfile noise ─────────────────────────────────────
Packages/packages-lock.json

# ─── LLMUnity native binaries ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LLMUnity drops ~4 GB of platform-specific llama.cpp native binaries (Linux x64,
# Windows x64, macOS arm64/x64/universal, Android arm64/x64, iOS arm64, visionOS)
# into StreamingAssets/LlamaLib-<version>/ on first install. Re-installable from
# the UPM package; committing them would 100x the repo size.
Assets/StreamingAssets/LlamaLib-*/
Assets/StreamingAssets/LlamaLib-*.meta

# ─── AI model binaries ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Models are downloaded from Hugging Face per the per-stage manifest.json files
# (which ARE tracked). Manifests carry SHA-256 hashes for post-download verification.
# To commit model files directly (e.g. private fork): comment out this block.
#
# Source-of-truth checkout
ai-models/**/*.onnx
ai-models/**/*.gguf
ai-models/**/*.db
ai-models/**/*.bin
ai-models/**/vocab.txt
ai-models/**/tokenizer.json
ai-models/**/config.json
ai-models/**/generation_config.json
ai-models/**/preprocessor_config.json
# Mirrored runtime copy
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/*.onnx
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/*.gguf
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/*.db
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/*.bin
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/vocab.txt
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/tokenizer.json
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/config.json
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/generation_config.json
Assets/StreamingAssets/VoiceAI/**/preprocessor_config.json

# ─── Docs site build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MkDocs writes the rendered HTML here when running locally. GitHub Pages
# deploys from a separate ephemeral build via .github/workflows/docs.yml.
site/

# ─── Packaging output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `tools/package-sauti.sh` writes here: tarball, SHA-256 manifest, staging
# tree, test results. Built artefacts; downloadable from GitHub Releases.
dist/

# ─── UPM tarballs (anywhere in the tree) ──────────────────────────────────────
*.tgz

# ─── Python caches (CI tools, MkDocs build venvs, validators) ─────────────────
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ─── CI / test outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unity test runner writes XML; GameCI workflows stage under artifacts/
test-results.xml
**/test-results.xml
artifacts/
**/artifacts/tests/

# ─── Local Claude / agent state ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Subagent task transcripts + tool-output streams. Only present when running
# Claude Code locally against this repo; never relevant on GitHub.
.claude/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project design history + engineering charter — TRACKED (flipped 2026-05-26)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both paths below carry the project's design history and engineering charter.
# Originally excluded; maintainer chose to include them so new contributors
# can trace decisions back to their rationale.
#
# memory/      — 15-file docs corpus including:
#                  • voice_ai_architecture.md (CANONICAL pipeline spec)
#                  • handover_session.md (append-only session audit trail)
#                  • api_surfaces.md (verified upstream API reference)
#                  • philosophy.md, project_context.md, agent_profile.md,
#                    architecture.md, mindmap.md, todo.md, etc.
#
# instructions/ — 760-line engineering operations guide (instruction.md)
#                 covering coding standards, build conventions, CI rules.
#
# To exclude either in a private fork, un-comment the matching line below.
# memory/
# instructions/
